sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Thymeleaf UI
    participant UC as UserController
    participant VR as VehicleRepository
    participant SR as ParkingSlotRepository
    participant BR as BookingRepository
    participant DB as MySQL database
    User->>UI: Select vehicle and parking slot
    UI->>UC: POST /user/book-slot
    UC->>VR: find vehicle for logged-in user
    UC->>SR: find slot and verify AVAILABLE
    UC->>BR: save Booking(Pending)
    UC->>SR: save slot status BOOKED
    SR->>DB: persist slot
    BR->>DB: persist booking
    UC-->>UI: Redirect to dashboard
    UI-->>User: Show booking confirmation
